\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"required_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bd_manager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"max_duration_months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fee.first_period_waiver\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"commission_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"required_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"region_head\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"max_duration_months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"traffic.new_merchant_slot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slots\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_weeks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"category_restricted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"required_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"max_duration_months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"settlement.accelerated_payout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T+3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_orders_per_week\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"required_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"finance_ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"max_duration_months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stacking_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_total_fee_discount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"incompatible_pairs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fee.first_period_waiver\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"traffic.new_merchant_slot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_items_per_pack_instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"版本不可变与实例引用\">版本不可变与实例引用</h3><p>三个字段承担了这套结构的安全责任。<strong><code>version</code> 与 <code>effective_to</code></strong>：政策到期后新实例不能引用它，防止 BD 拿过期政策对外承诺。<strong><code>required_authority</code></strong>：每一项让步都有一个最低授权级别，BD 不能越过。<strong><code>stacking_rules</code></strong>：单看每一项让步成本可控，叠加起来可能不可接受；<code>max_total_fee_discount</code> 给出总折扣上限，<code>incompatible_pairs</code> 禁止某些组合（例如「首期免佣」与「新商家流量位」同时给，等于开局零收入还挤占他人流量）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阶梯费率在行业中的实际形态\">阶梯费率在行业中的实际形态</h3><p>阶梯降档不是虚构的谈判工具，成熟平台的标准费率本身就是<strong>按品类与价格分档</strong>的。以 Amazon 的销售费用结构为例：专业卖家每月订阅费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39.99</mn><mtext>，单件商品另收按品类计算的推荐费（</mtext><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>），区间大致覆盖</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">39.99，单件商品另收按品类计算的推荐费（referral fee），区间大致覆盖 3%–45%，多数商品落在 8%–17%，且多为「百分比与最低金额取其高者」，大部分品类最低</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，单件商品另收按品类计算的推荐费（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">），区间大致覆盖</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>0.30（见 <a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing\">Amazon selling fees</a>）。这个结构对招商有两层含义：一是<strong>费率档位的谈判空间来自品类间的既有差异</strong>（同样的让步，在高费率品类里成本低得多），二是<strong>最低金额条款是常被忽略的成本项</strong>——对小额订单为主的商家，单件最低费可能比百分比更值钱。</p>\n<p><code>retroactive: false</code> 这一项值得单说：<strong>阶梯费率是否追溯</strong>是招商谈判中的经典分歧点。不追溯意味着商家达到下一档后，只有后续订单享受低费率；追溯意味着达到档位后当期全部订单按低费率结算。追溯的成本显著更高，并且会让商家的冲刺行为集中在季度末（套利窗口），因此绝大多数平台选择不追溯，但必须在政策里写清楚——否则 BD 现场无法回答商家「那我这个月多卖的部分怎么算」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权矩阵\">授权矩阵</h2><p>授权矩阵把「谁能给什么」变成一张可查询的表，取代了口头的授权链。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>让步幅度</th>\n<th>BD</th>\n<th>BD 主管</th>\n<th>区域负责人</th>\n<th>品类/财务/风控</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准费率档内（不改条款）</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降一档费率（承诺期 ≤12 个月）</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降两档 / 首期免佣</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>财务备案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金/物流补贴</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>✅（额度内）</td>\n<td>财务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目资质放宽</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>风控审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专属流量位</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>提交</td>\n<td>品类运营分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"提交与批准的双人约束\">提交与批准的双人约束</h3><p>矩阵的读法是：<strong>「提交」表示可以发起请求但不能自行承诺，「✅」表示可以直接给出</strong>。这个区分极其重要——BD 在电话里说「我帮您申请一下」和「我保证给您」是两种性质，前者不产生义务，后者产生。系统层面应当只有一个操作入口：BD 在 CRM 里构造<strong>政策包实例</strong>（选择 items、填入商家、系统做范围与叠加校验），实例提交后按 <code>required_authority</code> 路由给审批人，审批通过后实例才具有对外效力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[BD 构造政策包实例] --&gt; B{校验}&#10;  B --&gt;|版本已过期| B1[拒绝 提示当前版本]&#10;  B --&gt;|超出授权| B2[路由到上一级审批]&#10;  B --&gt;|叠加违规| B3[拒绝 提示冲突项]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[实例待审批]&#10;  C --&gt; D{审批}&#10;  D --&gt;|批准| E[实例生效 生成对外承诺单]&#10;  D --&gt;|驳回| F[附驳回理由 回 BD]&#10;  E --&gt; G[写入线索商机记录]&#10;  G --&gt; H[入驻后由履约系统核销]\">graph TD\n  A[BD 构造政策包实例] --&gt; B{校验}\n  B --&gt;|版本已过期| B1[拒绝 提示当前版本]\n  B --&gt;|超出授权| B2[路由到上一级审批]\n  B --&gt;|叠加违规| B3[拒绝 提示冲突项]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[实例待审批]\n  C --&gt; D{审批}\n  D --&gt;|批准| E[实例生效 生成对外承诺单]\n  D --&gt;|驳回| F[附驳回理由 回 BD]\n  E --&gt; G[写入线索商机记录]\n  G --&gt; H[入驻后由履约系统核销]</pre><p>图里最后一条边 <code>G --&gt; H</code> 是政策包体系与现实的接口：<strong>政策实例必须能被履约系统核销</strong>。如果 BD 承诺的降档费率在商家入驻后没有真的生效，那这次招商是用平台的信誉换来的——代价远高于那点费率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口头承诺与可兑现性\">口头承诺与可兑现性</h2><p>招商里最常见的事故形态是「口头承诺无法兑现」。它的成因有三个，每个都有对应的工程防线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>防线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引用了不存在的能力</td>\n<td>承诺了一个平台没有的产品</td>\n<td>政策项与履约系统能力清单做外键校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用了过期版本</td>\n<td>上季度的政策当季报出</td>\n<td>版本有效期校验 + 实例构造时强制选版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用了未生效政策</td>\n<td>政策还在审批中就对外说了</td>\n<td>只允许 <code>status = active</code> 的版本构造实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>还有第四种，更隐蔽：<strong>政策真实存在、也生效了，但商家不满足兑现条件</strong>。例如承诺「月销达 2 万降档」，而商家的实际月销核算口径与商家理解的口径不同（是否含退款、是否含运费、是否按自然月）。这类事故几乎全部来自<strong>口径未在承诺单上写明</strong>。解法是在对外承诺单上强制附上核算口径的引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;commitment_id&quot;: &quot;cmt_2026_08_0417&quot;,&#10;  &quot;merchant_ref&quot;: &quot;lead_id:88213&quot;,&#10;  &quot;policy_pack&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;apac_q3_2026&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;3.1.0&quot; },&#10;  &quot;committed_items&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;item&quot;: &quot;fee.tiered_stepdown&quot;,&#10;      &quot;params_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;tiers&quot;: [&#10;          { &quot;monthly_gmv&quot;: 0, &quot;rate&quot;: 0.06 },&#10;          { &quot;monthly_gmv&quot;: 20000, &quot;rate&quot;: 0.045 }&#10;        ],&#10;        &quot;retroactive&quot;: false&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;measurement_basis&quot;: &quot;order_gmv_net_of_refund_excl_shipping&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;approved_by&quot;: &quot;u_region_head_sg&quot;,&#10;  &quot;approved_at&quot;: &quot;2026-08-14T03:20:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-11-13T23:59:59Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"commitment_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cmt_2026_08_0417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"merchant_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lead_id:88213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policy_pack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apac_q3_2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"committed_items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fee.tiered_stepdown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"params_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"tiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"monthly_gmv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"monthly_gmv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.045</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"retroactive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"measurement_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_gmv_net_of_refund_excl_shipping\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"approved_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_region_head_sg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"approved_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-14T03:20:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-13T23:59:59Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>measurement_basis</code> 是这张承诺单上最重要的字段。它把「月销」这个模糊词钉死成一个可计算的表达式，商家与平台在任何后续争议中都可以回到这行字。缺少它的承诺单，等于把争议交给客服的临场解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"政策成本如何进入-roi\">政策成本如何进入 ROI</h2><p>每一项让步都是成本，必须能被 <a href=\"../recruit-roi-ops/recruit-channel-roi\">招商渠道 ROI 与成本</a> 核算进去。否则 BD 会倾向于用「给政策」换取容易签的单子，因为签约数上去了而成本被记在别处。成本归集的关键是<strong>把政策实例的成本建模为「相对标准条款的差额」并按承诺期摊分</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>instance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>eff</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>subsidy</mtext><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(\\text{instance}) = \\sum_{m=1}^{M} \\left( \\text{GMV}_m \\times (r_{\\text{std}} - r_{\\text{eff},m}) \\right) + \\text{subsidy}_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">instance</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">std</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">subsidy</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺期月数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>eff</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{eff},m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 月的实际生效费率（含阶梯变化）。由于未来 GMV 未知，实操中用<strong>同品类同规模商家的 GMV 分布中位数</strong>做前瞻估计，并在实际数据回填后修正。这条估计的存在本身就是一种约束：当 BD 看到「这单首期免佣预计成本 X」时，会更谨慎地使用它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>招商政策是标准条款之上的、有授权边界的例外集合，必须像代码一样版本化。</li>\n<li>让步拆成费率/流量/补贴/账期/服务/准入六个维度；成本类型决定审批人，可变现速度决定值不值。</li>\n<li>政策包版本不可变，实例引用具体版本；<code>stacking_rules</code> 限制总折扣与不兼容组合。</li>\n<li>授权矩阵的「提交」与「✅」必须严格区分，系统只允许通过实例构造这一个入口对外承诺。</li>\n<li>对外承诺单必须附 <code>measurement_basis</code> 核算口径，把模糊词钉成可计算的表达式。</li>\n<li>政策成本以「相对标准条款的差额」建模并摊入承诺期，纳入渠道 ROI，否则 BD 会用政策换签约数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"bd-activity-event-channel\">招商活动/展会/渠道获客</a> 讲如何批量地把线索灌进这套管道。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"招商政策与费率/补贴谈判包","id":"招商政策与费率-补贴谈判包"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：政策包的组合维度","id":"核心概念-政策包的组合维度"},{"level":2,"text":"政策包的版本化结构","id":"政策包的版本化结构"},{"level":3,"text":"版本不可变与实例引用","id":"版本不可变与实例引用"},{"level":3,"text":"阶梯费率在行业中的实际形态","id":"阶梯费率在行业中的实际形态"},{"level":2,"text":"授权矩阵","id":"授权矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"提交与批准的双人约束","id":"提交与批准的双人约束"},{"level":2,"text":"口头承诺与可兑现性","id":"口头承诺与可兑现性"},{"level":2,"text":"政策成本如何进入 ROI","id":"政策成本如何进入-roi"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线索阶段管理（招商 CRM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/bd-pipeline-negotiation/lead-stage-crm-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"招商活动/展会/渠道获客","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/bd-pipeline-negotiation/bd-activity-event-channel"}}